        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149938,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Örnekler aynı sınıf şablonundan başlasa da farklı şekillerde gelişebilir.<br /></p><p>Yenildiklerini belirtmek için <code>player1</code> ve <code>player3</code> öğelerinin <code>isAlive</code> durumunu değiştir.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"210\" endIndex=\"215\" /><option startIndex=\"235\" endIndex=\"240\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".isAlive = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bryn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player3 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Juno&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player1.isAlive = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player3.isAlive = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player2);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player3);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>false</code>, ardından <code>false</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149939,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir sınıfı değiştirmek, o sınıfın <em>tüm örneklerini</em> etkiler.</p><p>Artık tüm oyuncuların kısa bir durum mesajına sahip olması için bir <code>status</code> özelliği ekle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"92\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".isAlive = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".status = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ready for the next level&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Theon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player2.status);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>status</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149940,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir sınıfı değiştirirken hem özelliklerini <em>hem de</em><strong>metotlarını</strong> değiştirebiliriz.</p><p><code>Player</code> sınıfına ait yeni eklenen <code>attack()</code> metodunu çağırarak <code>Player</code> sınıfının tüm örneklerinin bu metodu nasıl kullanabildiğini gör.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"237\" endIndex=\"245\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".isAlive = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; attacks!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Juno&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player1.attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player2.attack();}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>attack()</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149941,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Constructor, bir örnek oluşturan yapıdır. Ancak içinde <em>her zaman</em> özellikler bulunması gerekmez. <strong>Boş</strong> olduğunda bile çalışır.<br /></p><p>Bu <code>Enemy</code> sınıfı için <code>constructor()</code> metodunu boş olarak ayarla. Bu, süslü parantezlerin arasında hiçbir şey olmadığı anlamına gelir.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"this.hp = 100;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" growl() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Grrr!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemy1.growl();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>{</code>, ardından <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149942,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yapıcılar sınıflar için o kadar önemlidir ki, eklemesek bile bir <strong>varsayılan yapıcı</strong> oluşturulur.</p><p>Bu durumda, kodu çalıştırdığımızda <code>enemy1</code> örneği <em>varsayılan</em> boş bir kurucuyla oluşturulur.<br /></p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"100\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" growl() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Grrr!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemy1.growl();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>enemy1</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
