nsole\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(pickup2.rarity);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>this</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve sonra <code>rarity</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>1;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
